{"id":"n69410-1-10","stage":3,"title":"용품 · 用品","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69410-1-10-1","ko":"아버지 생신 선물로 무엇이 좋을까?","zh":"作为父亲生日的礼物，选什么好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생신","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇이","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/793dcdaca92295c9937f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69410-1-10-2","ko":"골프를 좋아하시니까 골프 용품을 사 드리는 건 어때?","zh":"他喜欢高尔夫，送他高尔夫用品怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"골프를","meaning":"高尔夫，高尔夫球","explanation":"골프：高尔夫，高尔夫球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"골프","audio":"/audio/3da436a790727457a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27872","senseId":"1","lemma":"골프","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하시니까","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"골프","meaning":"高尔夫，高尔夫球","explanation":"골프：高尔夫，高尔夫球","readings":[{"term":"골프","audio":"/audio/3da436a790727457a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27872","senseId":"1","lemma":"골프","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"용품을","meaning":"用品","explanation":"용품：用品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"용품","audio":"/audio/3e2b6a5fdee466d63432.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69410","senseId":"1","lemma":"용품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드리는","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3da436a790727457","term":"골프","zh":"高尔夫，高尔夫球","audio":"/audio/3da436a790727457a81f.mp3","entryId":"27872","definition":"在广阔的草地里挖出一些小洞，以较长的球杆将一颗小球打进洞里的户外运动。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"3e2b6a5fdee466d6","term":"용품","zh":"用品","audio":"/audio/3e2b6a5fdee466d63432.mp3","entryId":"69410","definition":"为干某事或某个目的而使用的物品。","pronunciation":["용ː품"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/244accf21b7027fa5b0b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69410","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":93,"sequenceScore":2.5023,"